<body>
  <header><a class="brand" href="/"><span></span>StockTap</a><nav><a href="/problems/">Problems we fix</a><a href="/videos/">Videos</a><a href="/guides/">Guides</a><a href="/auth">Sign in</a></nav></header>
  <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">Postmix never adds up</span>
        <h1>Postmix that matches what you actually use.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Your stocktaker counts postmix in litres of drink. Your supplier sells it in boxes of syrup. Mix the two up and the order is miles out. StockTap keeps them straight.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="/auth?mode=signup" data-cta="problem-postmix-top">Start free</a><a class="btn2" href="/#tour">Watch the tour</a>
        <p class="note">14 days of Pro free, no card. Cancel any time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="phone"><video controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/media/poster-keg-box-sizes.jpg" src="/media/stocktap-keg-box-sizes.mp4" aria-label="Keg and postmix box sizes"></video></div>
    </div>
    <h2>How StockTap sorts it</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><b>Count it either way</b><p>Type litres of drink, like your stocktaker, or tap Boxes and type 1.4. StockTap shows both.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><b>Set your box size once</b><p>7, 10, 12 or 20 litres, or type your own.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><b>Set the yield</b><p>Standard boxes make about six times their size in drink, high-yield boxes about seven. Pick yours once per line.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><b>Orders in boxes</b><p>The order list tells you how many boxes to get, worked out from what you actually pour.</p></div>
    </div>
    <h2>What you need</h2>
    <div class="need">Your postmix box size and whether it&#x27;s standard or high yield (it&#x27;s usually on the box or the delivery note).</div>
    <div class="cta">
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px">Try it on your own bar</h2>
      <p style="color:#8A9099">14 days of Pro free, no card. Cancel any time. Your phone is all you need to start.</p>
      <a class="btn" style="margin-top:14px" href="/auth?mode=signup" data-cta="problem-postmix-bottom">Start free</a>
    </div>
    <h2>Other things StockTap sorts</h2>
    <div class="more">
      <a href="/problems/what-to-order">I never know what to order →</a>
      <a href="/problems/stocktake-down">My stocktake says I&#x27;m down →</a>
      <a href="/problems/busy-weekends">Busy weekends catch me short →</a>
      <a href="/problems/checking-deliveries">Deliveries take ages to check →</a>
      <a href="/problems/venners-audit">Got a Venners audit? →</a>
    </div>
    <p class="author">Written by Shaun McManus, licensee in Washington, Tyne &amp; Wear, who built StockTap to run behind his own bar.</p>
  </main>
